    "Description": "The pcs packages provide a command-line configuration system for the Pacemaker and Corosync utilities.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* tornado: Tornado Quadratic DoS via Repeated Header Coalescing (CVE-2025-67725)\n\n* tornado: Tornado Quadratic DoS via Crafted Multipart Parameters (CVE-2025-67726)\n\n* lodash: prototype pollution in _.unset and _.omit functions (CVE-2025-13465)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
